lbc3-1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.600 line:-1 align:center
Yes, Luigi is a very, very cheerful boy.

lbc3-2
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.600 line:-1 align:center
A boy who laughs a lot.

lbc3-3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.100 line:-1 align:center
You need that in motorsport.

lbc3-4
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:10.600 line:-1 align:center
Lots of laughter, because there are many, many bad days

lbc3-5
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:14.100 line:-1 align:center
that you have to get through.

lbc3-6
00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:15.800 line:-1 align:center
And he handles that pretty well.

lbc3-7
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.700 line:-1 align:center
Today, for example, was a test day for him.

lbc3-8
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.700 line:-1 align:center
He got through it well – and that really says a lot about him.

lbc3-9
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.100 line:-1 align:center
So a very, very cheerful boy – with a lot of talent too, of course.

lbc3-10
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:27.100 line:-1 align:center
Keeping up so well in only his second year

lbc3-11
00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:29.800 line:-1 align:center
in a championship like this, against drivers like these,

lbc3-12
00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:31.200 line:-1 align:center
is no small feat.

lbc3-13
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:32.600 line:-1 align:center
He’s done a really great job,

lbc3-14
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:35.500 line:-1 align:center
and I see a lot, a lot of potential in him.

lbc3-15
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.200 line:-1 align:center
He will definitely achieve a lot in the future,

lbc3-16
00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:39.500 line:-1 align:center
in the higher class too.

lbc3-17
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:44.400 line:-1 align:center
That’s why it’s good that we’re here now, gaining experience like this.
